64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "says the person who does not wear underwear"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2680.63, "timestamp": "00:44:40", "text": "两次。我确实收到了我的旧内裤。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2682.23, "timestamp": "00:44:42", "text": "被盗。所以这就是我告诉你的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2684.63, "timestamp": "00:44:44", "text": "总是因为你知道内衣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2686.79, "timestamp": "00:44:46", "text": "印度物价真是便宜到家了。就像他们一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2688.47, "timestamp": "00:44:48", "text": "便宜的。你可以得到大约300个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2690.95, "timestamp": "00:44:50", "text": "就像三四条内裤。但是那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2693.19, "timestamp": "00:44:53", "text": "你大概要付1000日元左右。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2693.918, "timestamp": "00:44:53", "author": "@swordfish_0219", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kyKEfV4DpM3RY4S4kitmAih-V8pz1JPa4McVrz_xjPFpsG=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "relax.... don't drop that lore here"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2694.539, "timestamp": "00:44:54", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "they stole my used underwear"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2696.15, "timestamp": "00:44:56", "text": "2000日元。这是便宜的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2699.349, "timestamp": "00:44:59", "text": "所以要常备一大包……"}]